From: SignKirigami <prcups@krgm.moe>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 22:44:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 31/37] AOSCOS: Adapt touchpad backend selection to the backend
 merger

Upstream-Id: 2721020359c3ffd76977f124c19f74abab497273

Retain TouchpadBackend as the selection interface for X11 and Wayland rather
than folding the interface into the Wayland backend. Update the settings
module to select the appropriate backend.

Assisted-by: gpt-6.1-sol
Signed-off-by: SignKirigami <prcups@krgm.moe>
---
